-300"> REGISTER NOW </span> </a> </li> </ul> <p class="w-full max-w-[1380px] text-center uppercase font-light tracking-[-0.01em] leading-tight text-[clamp(0.82rem,1.02vw,1.5rem)]"> <span class="word-clip" style="--word-index:14;"> <span class="word-inner">Questions?</span> </span><span class="word-clip" style="--word-index:15;"> <span class="word-inner">Contact</span> </span><span class="word-clip" style="--word-index:16;"> <span class="word-inner">the</span> </span><span class="word-clip" style="--word-index:17;"> <span class="word-inner">host</span> </span><span class="word-clip" style="--word-index:18;"> <span class="word-inner">to</span> </span><span class="word-clip" style="--word-index:19;"> <span class="word-inner">find</span> </span><span class="word-clip" style="--word-index:20;"> <span class="word-inner">out</span> </span><span class="word-clip" style="--word-index:21;"> <span class="word-inner">more.</span> </span> </p> </div> </section>   </div> <div id="application-modal" data-modal="application" class="fixed inset-0 z-[120] hidden items-center justify-center bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-sm" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true"> <div data-modal-panel class="mx-4 w-full max-w-[750px] border border-white/20 bg-black/95 p-[64px] md:p-10"> <button type="button" data-modal-close="application" class="ml-auto block border border-white/40 px-4 py-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/85 transition-colors hover:bg-white hover:text-black" aria-label="Close modal">
Close
